{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"afb7a2f3-257a-4a32-a767-1ef986f9ce0b","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented the required fixes for the Intervals.icu OAuth integration:\n\n- Added a **POST** `auth_init` endpoint that returns the authorize URL as JSON.\n- Updated routing to handle POST requests and return 405 for legacy GET.\n- Modified the frontend to use a **button** that POSTs to `/api/intervals/auth/init`, processes the JSON response, and redirects the user.\n- Simplified the token exchange to send only the required fields (`client_id`, `client_secret`, `code`).\n- Corrected the OAuth **scope** configuration to avoid duplicate entries.\n- Adjusted refresh‑token handling to log missing refresh tokens and treat access tokens as permanent until revoked.\n\nThe detailed explanation of the changes, the parts of the colleague’s note that were used, and the resulting behavior are documented in the generated **ANSWER.md** file.\n\n[ANSWER.md](/Users/valentinakoniukhova/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/afb7a2f3-257a-4a32-a767-1ef986f9ce0b/ANSWER.md)\n","duration_seconds":330.829135,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":48776,"output_tokens":29808,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":869120,"total_tokens":78584}}}
